{
  "id": "1SA.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samuele 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Samuele ne, Wewe neudile muadi bua Shaula musangu bule munyi bualu bua meme nakamuhidia mu bukelenge bua Isalele? Ûshe lusengu luebe ne manyi tente, uye biebe, nenkutume kudi Yishai, Muena Beteleheme, bualu bua nakadisunguila mukelenge munkatshi mua bana bandi ba balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakamba ne, Nenye munyi? Biunvua Shaula lumu elu, yeye neanshihe. Yehowa wakamba ne, Uye ne lukungulu lua ngombe, Wamba ne, Nyaya bua kushihela Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubikile Yishai ku tshishihelu, nenkuleshe bualu bûdi ne bua kuenza; wewe newele manyi ha mutu ha undi nkuambila dina diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakenza muakamba Yehowa, wakaya ku Beteleheme. Bakulu ba musoko bakalua kumuakidila, benda bazakala, bakakonka ne, Ulualua ne ditalala, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Ditalala didiku, nakulala bua kushihela Yehowa nyama; nudilengeshe, nulue kundi ku tshishihelu. Yeye wakalengesha Yishai ne bana bandi ba balume, wakababikila ku tshishihelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaluabo, yeye wakatangila Eliaba, wakamba ne, Bulelela, udi Yehowa musungule udi ku mpala kuandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehowa wakambila Samuele ne, Kutangidi mpala wandi, anyi bule buandi, bualu bua meme nakamuhidia; Yehowa kena utangila bu mudi bantu batangila, bualu bua bantu badi batangila anu mubidi, kadi Yehowa udi utangila mu mutshima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yishai wakabikila Abinadaba, wakamuhitshisha ku mpala kua Samuele. Wakamba ne, Yehowa kena musungule eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishai wakatatshisha Shama ku mpala kuandi. Yeye wakamba ne, Yehowa kena musungule eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishai wakahitshisha bana bandi ba balume muanda mutekete ku mpala kua Samuele. Samuele wakambila Yishai ne, Yehowa kena musungule aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakakonka Yishai ne, Bana bebe bonso badiku, anyi? Yeye wakamba ne, Muanʼa mukala utshidi mushale; mona, yeye udi ulama mikoko. Samuele wakambila Yishai ne, Bamubikile, bualu bua katuena tushikama tô ne halueye kunoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakatuma di, bakalua nʼandi. Yeye wakadi ne mpala lukunjila-kunjila, wakadi ne mesu mimpe, wakadi muakane kumona. Yehowa wakamba ne, Bika, umuele manyi ha mutu, eu nyeye mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Samuele wakangata lusengu lua manyi, wakamuela manyi ha mutu handi munkatshi mua bana babo; Nyuma wa Yehowa wakatulukila Davidi bikole ku dituku adi. Nunku Samuele wakajuka, wakahingana ku Lama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma wa Yehowa wakumuka kudi Shaula ne nyuma mubi mufume kudi Yehowa wakamutatshisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena mudimu ba Shaula bakamuambila ne, Tangila, nyuma mubi kudi Nzambi udi ukutatshisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wetu ambile bena mudimu badi ku mpala kuandi ne, Nuye, nunkebele muntu udi mumanye mua kungimbila tshisanji bimpe: hashishe halua nyuma mubi mufume kudi Nzambi kudi, yeye neimbe tshisanji ne tshianza tshiandi ne wewe newikale bimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakambila bena mudimu bandi ne, Nunkebele muntu udi mumanye mua kuimba bimpe, nulue nʼandi kundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe umue wa bansongalume bandi wakamba ne, Mona, nakatangila muana wa balume wa Yishai, Muena Beteleheme, udi mumanye mua kuimba tshisanji bimpe, udi muntu wa bukitu, muena nvita mene, udi Wamba mei a lungenyi, udi ne mpala mulengele: Yehowa udi nʼandi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Shaula wakatuma ba-messager kudi Yishai, bamba ne, Untumine Davidi, muanʼebe, udi ulama mikoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishai wakangata nyama wa mpunda, wakateka mampa ne mulondo wa nvinyo, ne muana wa mukoko ha nyima handi, wakatuma nʼabi Davidi, muanʼandi, kudi Shaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakalua kudi Shaula, wakimana ku mpala kuandi: yeye wakatamba kumunanga; ne yeye wakalua mutuadi wa ngabu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakatumina Yishai di ne, Witabushe, ndi nkusengelela, bua Davidi ikale nʼanyi, bualu bua yeye udi ne diakalengele ku mesu kuanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakalua nyuma mubi mufume kudi Nzambi kudi Shaula, hashishe Davidi wakangata tshisanji, wakatshimba ne tshianza tshiandi: Shaula wakadi usangala, wakalua bimpe, ne nyuma mubi wakumuka kudiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
